":"ea4027b5-1c94-48ec-b216-357ad1b65c57","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ところで runner が terminal の場合はそもそも outputter は無視されるはずなんだけどな","ts":"1634706647.060800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d0qk9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99e6e25b-6cb6-4362-aa9c-41ab2e9cd1b9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"解決\n```let g:quickrun_config['_']['outputter/buffer/opener'] = 'botright 8split'\nlet g:quickrun_config['_']['hook/shebang/enable'] = 1\nlet g:quickrun_config['_']['runner'] = 'job'```","ts":"1634706561.060100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IkKA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2550a053-087e-4eff-8885-3431f5c20eb0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"opener 指定できると便利","ts":"1634706545.059800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bRZ5V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2482fa2f-04b6-450e-b237-2be62f81a412","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"引数にファイル名が来るようなコマンドを opener に指定します","ts":"1634706501.059600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q7NC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d13b3b19-1014-417f-b860-6898a5d6a042","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"split ではなくて opener ですね","ts":"1634706471.059100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b05ec8c6-a0d8-45b6-a449-3d3e2f0c1676","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"job にしたら botright 効かなくなった。","ts":"1634706431.058800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xbW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3b1f506-b22e-4b33-bacb-134383ff0372","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いい加減やらないとなぁ","ts":"1634706415.058500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"igJqX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0775c3a4-a47e-4667-8d92-dacf9a144c76","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"job は大丈夫ぽかったので job にしよう。","ts":"1634706361.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZCk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"595b14f2-3a17-48a5-970f-99311956717f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なるほど。","ts":"1634706302.057900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lLw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c606d25c-d102-4440-906d-3655d3163ca5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、terminal は毎回開いちゃいます…それはあまり嬉しくないので直そうと思っていたやつ…","ts":"1634706293.057700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C+Hu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ace35694-858f-4658-b855-6bbc778f2358","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```let g:quickrun_config['_'] = {}\n\nlet g:quickrun_config['_']['outputter/buffer/split'] = ':botright 8'\nlet g:quickrun_config['_']['hook/shebang/enable'] = 1\nlet g:quickrun_config['_']['runner'] = 'terminal'```","ts":"1634706261.057100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C=J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"553eb02d-755d-4844-89d0-92983dd5c7b5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、もしかして runner が terminal だから？","ts":"1634706248.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ViI2e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90352aea-2610-4b6a-96c4-0b7a654400a0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"実行する毎に分割ウィンドウが開いて実行されます。","ts":"1634706230.056600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"glCLx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c9864d6-1abb-48e6-87d9-fa29bf9a8105","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バッファは実行毎に中身をクリアしてます。クリアせずに追記したい場合は `outputter/buffer/append` を 1 にします。","ts":"1634706211.056300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"50t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0b29776-a5b4-460b-8774-fef2a0c8e3ae","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"が、されて無さそうという話でした。(もしかしてバグ...)","ts":"1634706169.055600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oe2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ef09d85-f418-478e-9209-62d391a446e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バッファ自体は使い回してます","ts":"1634706155.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8/kx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"609a6fe8-c75a-49b2-a8a9-059d07f2d8e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"閉じてたら開きますね","ts":"1634706142.054900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"axr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85411614-4beb-404b-bb2e-bdaae5f170c5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"実行する毎にバッファ開きません？","ts":"1634706116.054500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLG6o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1422f76b-db3e-43b8-baa4-5b8ad8917b25","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"1 枚とは?","ts":"1634706085.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UG8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ad5c642-0aa7-4c8b-9e46-9c201976e748","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"調べるのめんどくさい太郎。","ts":"1634706056.053600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zTNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ea434e-603c-48d4-ab74-8fe9aaf4a50e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"quickrun で結果バッファを1枚にするみたいな事って誰かやってたりしませんか。","ts":"1634706049.053300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":